Model and proxy:
- Qwen/Qwen3-235B-A22B, open weights, Apache-2.0:
  https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-235B-A22B
- Supported alternatives Qwen3-30B-A3B and Qwen3-8B are configured by exact allowlisted model IDs.
- CometAPI is a third-party hosted proxy: https://www.cometapi.com/qwen-3-api/
  Its account terms, quota and charges apply when configured. No key is committed.
- No weights are bundled or downloaded by the application. The proxy may update serving infrastructure independently.
- Without the proxy the application explicitly uses deterministic rules, not a claimed LLM response.
- The legacy prototype retains separate CometAPI settings and is outside the new cabinet's model path.

Simulations, not real integrations:
- EGRUL/EGRIP, BKI, FNS Transparent Business: deterministic synthetic DataSource adapters.
- ContractGateway and PaymentGateway: success/failure simulation only; no actual payments, bank contract or signatures.
- Documentary packages and financial/account/company fixtures: authored synthetic data, not purchased datasets.
- Rates, policy thresholds, score and cash-flow assumptions: demonstrative rules, not validated bank risk models.

